.TH V23FORTUNE 1
.SH NAME
wm/v23fortune \- Vanadium fortune demo for wm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/v23fortune
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Wm/v23fortune
is a
.IR wm (1)
Tk client that demonstrates the Limbo Vanadium port
.RI ( v23-intro (2)).
On start it creates a server principal and a client principal
(256-bit Elgamal for speed), starts an in-process fortune RPC server on
.BR tcp!*!3242
(clients dial
.BR tcp!127.0.0.1!3242 ),
and lets the user
.BR Get ,
.BR Add ,
or
.B Has
fortunes over
.IR v23-rpc (2).
.PP
The client is pre-seeded with the server’s self-blessing as a trusted root
(same-process demo). The server ACL is
.B ...
(TOFU for callers).
.B Selftest
loads
.IR v23-selftest (1)
in-process.
.PP
Launch from the toolbar:
.B Misc → V23 Fortune
or
.BR Vanadium → Fortune ,
or
.BR wmapp /Apps/!V23Fortune .
.SH FILES
.TF /Apps/!V23Fortune
.TP
.B /Apps/!V23Fortune
App folder (
.BR !Run
runs
.BR wm/v23fortune )
.TP
.B /dis/wm/v23fortune.dis
Implementation
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/v23fortune.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR v23-intro (2),
.IR v23-fortune (1),
.IR v23-fortuned (8),
.IR v23-selftest (1),
.IR toolbar (1)
